  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.
</para>
<para>
  Simplify each expression using the appropriate property from the lesson. Double click on mathematical expressions/equations to enlarge.
</para>
<!--Do not edit this div tag.  It must surround the interaction block-->
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="5bc25e84-3ebc-45a4-b6f7-6fbd0bb8aa7c"><problem><para>
      <para> \(f^2 \cdot f^6\)</para>
      </para><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(f^{36}\) </para><para>\(f^4\) </para><para>\(f^{12}\) </para><para>\(f^8\)</para></problem><solution><para>\(f^8\)</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is \(f^8\).
      </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
